# Compile All Simple Module Examples
# This file compiles one entry point that references all three modules.
# Reflaxe writes a generated-file manifest per target, so one target keeps
# BasicModule, MathHelper, and UserUtil in the same lib/ output.
-lib reflaxe.elixir
-cp src_haxe
-D elixir_output=lib
-D reflaxe_elixir_strict_examples
SimpleModulesMain
